      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: My postdoc left me a weighted edge list (source, target, weight) from our zebrafish heart-regeneration project, and I'd like CONDOR communities from it. I can't remember whether it's her TF-to-gene network or the gene-gene co-expression network she also built.\nUser follow-up: It's the gene-gene co-expression network."
